unavailable-subtitle: [? if army_strength < 5 : We have no troops to spare to send to Louisiana. ?][? if LA_occupation_posture <= 0 : Louisiana is currently under civilian control. We would need to establish a federal presence first. ?][? if LA_occupation_posture = 1 and LA_garrison_troops + 5 > 15 : A light federal presence cannot support a larger garrison. Full military government is required to deploy further. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.LA_garrison_troops += 5;
    Q.army_strength -= 5;
    Q.South_army_strength += 5;
    Q.dem_relation -= 2;
    Q.moderate_dissent = (Q.moderate_dissent || 0) + 1;
!}

We send another regiment to the state of Louisiana to enforce federal authority across the state.

@Occ_LA_Crack
title: Crack down on local paramilitaries in Louisiana
choose-if: LA_kkk_strength > 0 or LA_whiteL_strength > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if LA_kkk_strength <= 0 and (whiteL_formed = 0 or LA_whiteL_strength <= 0) : The Klan and White League have both been eradicated in Louisiana. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    let troops = Q.LA_garrison_troops || 0;
    let kkkReduction = Math.min(20, 3 + troops * 0.3);
    let whiteLReduction = Math.min(10, 1 + troops * 0.12);
    if (Q.whiteL_formed == 1) {
        Q.LA_kkk_strength = Math.max(0, Q.LA_kkk_strength - kkkReduction);
        Q.LA_whiteL_strength = Math.max(0, Q.LA_whiteL_strength - whiteLReduction);
        Q.South_army_strength -= 3;
        Q.dem_relation -= 3;
        Q.radical_strength += 3;
        Q.conservative_strength -= 3;
        Q.conservative_dissent += 2;
    }
    else 
    {
        Q.LA_kkk_strength = Math.max(0, Q.LA_kkk_strength - kkkReduction);
        Q.South_army_strength -= 1;
        Q.dem_relation -= 3;
        Q.radical_strength += 3;
        Q.conservative_strength -= 3;
        Q.conservative_dissent += 2;
    }
!}

United States forces, together with the Union League and local police, move to arrest and suppress Klan[? if whiteL_formed = 1 : and White League ?] activity in Louisiana.


@MS_posture
title: Mississippi

Mississippi currently has [+ MS_garrison_troops +] thousand federal troops stationed, at [? if MS_occupation_posture = 0 : no federal presence ?][? if MS_occupation_posture = 1 : a light federal presence ?][? if MS_occupation_posture = 2 : full military government ?]. Klan strength in the state stands at [+ MS_kkk_strength +][? if whiteL_formed = 1 : , with White League strength at [+ MS_whiteL_strength +] ?].

- @Occ_MS_Increase: Increase presence in Mississippi
- @Occ_MS_Reduce: Reduce occupation level
- @Occ_MS_Send: Send additional troops
- @Occ_MS_Crack: Crack down on local paramilitaries

@Occ_MS_Increase
title: Increase presence in Mississippi
choose-if: MS_occupation_posture < occupation and army_strength >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: [? if MS_occupation_posture >= occupation : National policy does not currently authorize a stronger presence here. ?][? if army_strength < 3 : The army does not have troops to spare. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.MS_occupation_posture += 1;
    Q.army_strength -= 3;
    Q.MS_garrison_troops += 3;
    Q.South_army_strength += 3;
    Q.dem_relation -= 1;
    Q.rural_dem += 1;
!}

More federal troops move into Mississippi, and Reconstruction officials' writ now runs further into the countryside.[? if MS_occupation_posture = 2 : With full military government now in place, they can act with far less fear of local reprisal. ?]

@Occ_MS_Reduce
title: Reduce occupation level in Mississippi
choose-if: MS_occupation_posture > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if MS_occupation_posture <= 0 : Mississippi is already free from federal oversight. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    let returning = Math.min(Q.MS_garrison_troops || 0, Math.max(3, Math.round((Q.MS_garrison_troops || 0) * 0.5)));
    Q.MS_occupation_posture -= 1;
    Q.MS_garrison_troops -= returning;
    Q.army_strength += returning;
    Q.South_army_strength -= returning;
    Q.dem_relation += 2;
    Q.moderate_dissent = Math.max(0, (Q.moderate_dissent || 0) - 1);
!}

Federal troops pull back from Mississippi. <span style="color: #0015bc;">**Democrats**</span> welcome the news, while <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> officials and freedmen in the state grow uneasy about what happens once the soldiers are gone.

